 match more than 60 weapons, more than 40 sets of suits, and hundreds of treasures, blessings and bond nodes with different effects, to create a unique construction that belongs only to you! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/1bac0cc3f72342a2752c4065602dc38d.avif?t=1745643014\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/748509ed687da013632d7c7f9386a668.avif?t=1745643014\" width=620 height=178 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/50fb2a5f8f63d7b18be14e9b699c2dae.poster.avif?t=1745643014\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/50fb2a5f8f63d7b18be14e9b699c2dae.webm?t=1745643014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/50fb2a5f8f63d7b18be14e9b699c2dae.mp4?t=1745643014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Diverse ways to start the game, random events in between battles, and repeated choices and tests make each adventure experience more different! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/ca8ee2f91d87486cc357c1bea0c2c399.avif?t=1745643014\" width=600 height=83 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521320/extras/72bc76f29f7b9fe3665567539c6a5981.avif?t=1745643014\" width=607 height=181 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh